id: GO:0000354
name: cis assembly of pre-catalytic spliceosome
namespace: biological_process
def: "Assembly of a spliceosomal complex containing the intact pre-mRNA and all of the spliceosomal snRNPs. This occurs when the tri-snRNP associates with the pre-mRNA and associated snRNPs in an ATP-dependent manner." [GOC:krc, ISBN:0879695897]
narrow_synonym: "formation of spliceosomal A2-1 complex" []
narrow_synonym: "formation of spliceosomal B1 complex" []
