namespace: biological_process
def: "Recognition of the intron 5'-splice site by components of the assembling U2-type spliceosome. This may involve binding of U1 snRNA and/or U6 snRNA to intron sequences." [GOC:krc, ISBN:0879695897]
comment: Note that this step represents formation of the Commitment Complex (CC, in yeast) or the E complex (mammalian).
