namespace: cellular_component
alt_id: GO:0000925
alt_id: GO:0000926
def: "A centrosome-localized multiprotein complex composed of gamma-tubulin and other non-tubulin proteins assembled into a ring structure that is thought to be the unit of nucleation at the minus end of a microtubule. Gamma-tubulin small complexes are thought to be the core repeating units of the ring." [GOC:clt, GOC:mtg_sensu, PMID:12134075, PMID:17021256]
exact_synonym: "gamma-tubulin large complex (sensu Metazoa)" []
