name: replication of extrachromosomal circular DNA
namespace: biological_process
def: "Replication of circular DNA following excision from the chromosome; replication of extrachromosomal circular DNA generally occurs independently of chromosomal replication." [GOC:jh]
subset: gosubset_prok
is_a: GO:0006260 ! DNA replication

[Term]
id: GO:0001400
