def: "OBSOLETE. Large glycoprotein that is a calcium binding component of connective tissue microfibrils containing 34 six-cysteine (EGF-like) repeats and five eight-cysteine (TGFbeta-1 binding protein-like) repeats. Defects associated with Marfan syndrome." [ISBN:0198506732 "Oxford Dictionary of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology"]
