[Term]
id: GO:0002087
name: neurological control of breathing
namespace: biological_process
def: "The processes pertaining to the functions of the nervous system that are required for the proper control of respiratory gaseous exchange. These processes occur in the respiratory center of the brain in vertebrates." [GOC:dph, PMID:12458206]
