relationship: part_of GO:0007585 ! respiratory gaseous exchange

[Term]
id: GO:0002088
name: lens development in camera-type eye
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the lens over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The lens is a transparent structure in the eye through which light is focused onto the retina." [GOC:dph, ISBN:0582064333]
