[Term]
id: GO:0002474
name: antigen processing and presentation of peptide antigen via MHC class I
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process by which an antigen-presenting cell expresses a peptide antigen on its cell surface in association with an MHC class I protein complex. Class I here refers to classical class I molecules." [GOC:add, ISBN:0781735149 "Fundamental Immunology", PMID:15224092, PMID:15771591]
