def: "The synthesis or release of nitric oxide following a stimulus during an acute inflammatory response, resulting in an increase in its intracellular or extracellular levels." [GOC:add, ISBN:0781735149 "Fundamental Immunology"]
is_a: GO:0002532 ! production of molecular mediator of acute inflammatory response

[Term]
id: GO:0002538
