[Term]
id: GO:0005502
name: 11-cis retinal binding
namespace: molecular_function
def: "Interacting selectively with 11-cis retinal, an isomer of retinal that plays an important role in the visual process in most vertebrates. 11-cis retinal combines with opsin in the rods (scotopsin) to form rhodopsin or visual purple. Retinal is one of the three compounds that makes up vitamin A." [http://cancerweb.ncl.ac.uk/]
