namespace: cellular_component
def: "A collagen homotrimer of alpha1(III) chains; type III collagen triple helices associate to form fibrils." [ISBN:0721639976]
is_a: GO:0005583 ! fibrillar collagen

[Term]
id: GO:0005587
name: collagen type IV
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A collagen heterotrimer containing type IV alpha chains; [alpha1(IV)]2alpha2(IV) trimers are commonly observed, although more type IV alpha chains exist and may be present in type IV trimers; type IV collagen triple helices associate to form nets within basement membranes." [ISBN:0721639976]
