[Term]
id: GO:0005757
name: mitochondrial permeability transition pore complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A protein complex that connects the inner and outer membranes of animal mitochondria and acts as a pore that can open transiently to allow free diffusion of solutes between the mitochondrial matrix and the cytosol." [PMID:10393078]
