[Term]
id: GO:0006283
name: transcription-coupled nucleotide-excision repair
namespace: biological_process
def: "The preferential repair of DNA lesions on the actively transcribed strand of the DNA duplex. In addition, the transcription-coupled nucleotide-excision repair pathway is required for the recognition and repair of a small subset of lesions that are not recognized by the general nucleotide excision repair pathway." [PMID:10197977, PMID:11900249]
