namespace: biological_process
def: "OBSOLETE (was not defined before being made obsolete)." [GOC:go_curators]
comment: This term was made obsolete because it represents two concepts. To update annotations, consider biological_process terms 'cellular bud site selection ; GO:0000282' or its children and 'establishment of cell polarity (sensu Fungi) ; GO:0030468' or its children.
is_obsolete: true

[Term]
id: GO:0007116
