namespace: biological_process
def: "Progression through anaphase of meiosis II; analogous to mitotic anaphase." [GOC:mah]
is_a: GO:0051322 ! anaphase
relationship: part_of GO:0007135 ! meiosis II

[Term]
id: GO:0007139
