[Term]
id: GO:0007311
name: maternal determination of dorsal/ventral axis, oocyte, germ-line encoded
namespace: biological_process
def: "Polarization of the oocyte along the dorsal-ventral axis, by a gene product encoded by cells of the germ line." [ISBN:0879694238]
is_a: GO:0007310 ! oocyte dorsal/ventral axis determination

[Term]
id: GO:0007312
name: oocyte nucleus migration during oocyte axis determination
namespace: biological_process
alt_id: GO:0008102
def: "The directed movement of the oocyte nucleus within the cell during the establishment and maintenance of the axes of the oocyte." [GOC:mah]
