[Term]
id: GO:0007313
name: maternal determination of dorsal/ventral axis, oocyte, soma encoded
namespace: biological_process
def: "Polarization of the oocyte along the dorsal-ventral axis, by a gene product encoded by somatic cells." [ISBN:0879694238]
is_a: GO:0007310 ! oocyte dorsal/ventral axis determination

[Term]
id: GO:0007314
name: oocyte anterior/posterior axis determination
namespace: biological_process
def: "Polarization of the oocyte along its anterior-posterior axis." [ISBN:0879694238]
is_a: GO:0009948 ! anterior/posterior axis specification
relationship: part_of GO:0007309 ! oocyte axis determination

[Term]
id: GO:0007315
name: pole plasm assembly
namespace: biological_process
def: "Establishment of the specialized cytoplasm found at the poles of the egg." [GOC:mtg_sensu]
