namespace: biological_process
def: "A pathway of blood coagulation that occurs during the clotting of platelet-poor plasma, in which activation of factor X to factor Xa is effected by the combination of factor IXa + factor VIIIa + calcium ion + phospholipid." [ISBN:0198506732 "Oxford Dictionary of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology"]
comment: See also the biological process term 'blood coagulation, extrinsic pathway ; GO:0007598'.
