namespace: molecular_function
def: "OBSOLETE. Catalysis of the reaction: GTP + H2O = GDP + phosphate. Activity is associated with the signal-recognition particle, a protein and RNA-containing structure involved in endoplasmic reticulum-associated protein synthesis." [EC:3.6.5.4, MetaCyc:3.6.1.49-RXN]
comment: This term was made obsolete because it represents a gene product. To update annotations, use cellular_component term 'signal recognition particle, endoplasmic reticulum targeting ; GO:0005786' and molecular_function term 'GTPase activity ; GO:0003924'.
is_obsolete: true

