namespace: cellular_component
def: "A narrow cylindrical tubule that runs through the center of a plasmodesma connecting two cells. The latter appears to be continuous with elements of the endoplasmic reticulum membrane of the interconnected cells." [ISBN:0198506732 "Oxford Dictionary of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology"]
