def: "The process that gives rise to a shoot. This process pertains to the initial formation of a structure from unspecified parts." [GOC:tb]
is_a: GO:0048646 ! anatomical structure formation
relationship: part_of GO:0010016 ! shoot morphogenesis

[Term]
