name: regulation of gibberellin biosynthetic process
namespace: biological_process
def: "Any process that modulates the frequency, rate or extent of the chemical reactions and pathways resulting in the formation of gibberellins." [GOC:TAIR_curator]
narrow_synonym: "regulation of gibberellic acid biosynthetic process" []
