def: "Any process that activates, maintains or increases the frequency, rate or extent of the chemical reactions and pathways resulting in the formation of gibberellins." [GOC:TAIR_curator]
narrow_synonym: "positive regulation of gibberellic acid biosynthetic process " []
is_a: GO:0010371 ! regulation of gibberellin biosynthetic process

[Term]
id: GO:0010373
