comment: This term was made obsolete because 'heavy metal' is an ambiguous grouping term which has no set meaning (see Pure Appl. Chem. Vol. 74, No. 5, pp. 793-807, 2002, for more information). To update annotations, consider molecular_function term 'metal ion transporter activity ; GO:0046873' or its children.
