relationship: part_of GO:0030917 ! midbrain-hindbrain boundary development

[Term]
id: GO:0021733
name: caudal lateral line nerve development
namespace: biological_process
def: "The progression of the caudal lateral line nerve over time from its initial formation until its mature state. The caudal lateral line nerve is a sensory afferent projecting from the posterior lateral line ganglion to the hindbrain in fishes." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06, ISBN:0125296509]
