[Term]
id: GO:0021976
name: medulla reticulospinal tract morphogenesis
namespace: biological_process
def: "Generation of a long process of a CNS neuron, that carries efferent (outgoing) action potentials from the cell body in the medulla towards target cells in the spinal cord." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
