relationship: part_of GO:0001843 ! neural tube closure

[Term]
id: GO:0021995
name: neuropore closure
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process of joining together the neural folds at either end of the neural tube." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
is_a: GO:0009653 ! anatomical structure morphogenesis
relationship: part_of GO:0001843 ! neural tube closure

[Term]
id: GO:0021996
name: lamina terminalis formation
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process whereby the anterior-most portion of the neural axis is formed by closure of the anterior neuropore." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
is_a: GO:0009653 ! anatomical structure morphogenesis
relationship: part_of GO:0021506 ! anterior neuropore closure

[Term]
id: GO:0021997
name: neural plate pattern formation
namespace: biological_process
def: "The pattern specification process whereby the axes of the nervous system are established." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
is_a: GO:0009798 ! axis specification
relationship: part_of GO:0001840 ! neural plate development

[Term]
id: GO:0021998
name: neural plate mediolateral pattern formation
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process that regulates the coordinated growth and differentiation that establishes the non-random mediolateral spatial arrangement of the neural plate." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
