[Term]
id: GO:0022000
name: forebrain induction by the anterior neural ridge
namespace: biological_process
def: "The close range interaction of the anterior neural ridge to the caudal region of the neural plate that specifies the forebrain fate." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
