def: "The series of molecular signals that stops, prevents or reduces the frequency, rate or extent of the directed movement of a cell from adopting an anterior neural cell fate, generated as a consequence of a fibroblast growth factor receptor binding to one of its physiological ligands." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic, GOC:mtg_15jun06]
comment: This term was added by GO_REF:0000021.
