comment: This term was made obsolete because it represents a function rather than a process. To update annotations, use biological_process terms 'calcium ion transport ; GO:0006816' and 'sodium ion transport ; GO:0006814' and consider molecular_function term 'calcium:sodium antiporter activity ; GO:0005432'.
is_obsolete: true

