namespace: cellular_component
def: "A protein complex required for the biogenesis of specialized organelles of the endosomal-lysosomal system, such as melanosomes and platelet dense granules. Many of the protein subunits are conserved between mouse and human; the mouse complx contains the Pallidin, Muted, Cappuccino, Dysbindin, Sapin, BLOS1, BLOS2, AND BLOS3 proteins." [PMID:15102850]
