namespace: biological_process
def: "The formation and growth of otoliths, the large extracellular ear-stones of the fish inner ear, by precipitation of specific crystal forms of calcium carbonate on organic matrices. As in, but not restricted to, the ray-finned fishes (Actinopterygii, ncbi_taxonomy_id:7898)." [GOC:dsf, PMID:15581873]
is_a: GO:0045299 ! otolith mineralization

