namespace: cellular_component
def: "The catalytic sector of the mitochondrial hydrogen-transporting ATP synthase; it comprises the catalytic core and central stalk, and is peripherally associated with the choroplast thylakoid membrane when the entire ATP synthase is assembled. The choroplast F0 domain contains three alpha, three beta, one gamma, one delta, and one epsilon subunits." [GOC:mah, GOC:pj, PMID:11032839]
