subset: gosubset_prok
is_a: GO:0044409 ! entry into host
is_a: GO:0051829 ! entry into other organism through natural portals during symbiotic interaction

[Term]
id: GO:0044411
name: entry into host through host barriers
namespace: biological_process
def: "Penetration by an organism into its host organism via active breaching of the physical barriers of the host organism. The host is defined as the larger of the organisms involved in a symbiotic interaction." [GOC:cc]
