def: "Catalysis of the reaction: (E)-4-hydroxy-3-methylbut-2-en-1-yl diphosphate + H2O + protein-disulfide = 2-C-methyl-D-erythritol 2,4-cyclodiphosphate + protein-dithiol. Note that (E)-4-hydroxy-3-methylbut-2-en-1-yl diphosphate is an alternative way of naming 1-hydroxy-2-methyl-2-(E)-butenyl 4-diphosphate." [EC:1.17.4.3, PMID:11752431]
subset: gosubset_prok
exact_synonym: "1-hydroxy-2-methyl-2-(E)-butenyl 4-diphosphate synthase activity" []
xref_analog: EC:1.17.4.3
is_a: GO:0016728 ! oxidoreductase activity, acting on CH2 groups, disulfide as acceptor

