[Term]
id: GO:0046691
name: intracellular canaliculus
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A narrow enfolded luminal membrane channel, lined with numerous microvilli, that appears to extend into the cytoplasm of the cell. A specialized network of intracellular canaliculi is a characteristic feature of parietal cells of the gastric mucosa in vertebrates." [ISBN:0721662544, PMID:10700045]
