namespace: cellular_component
def: "A multiprotein complex that consists of at least three proteins, CD14, TLR4, and MD-2, each of which is glycosylated." [PMID:11706042]
comment: Note that this term should not be used to refer to CD14 alone, but the multiprotein receptor complex that it is part of.
exact_synonym: "LPS receptor complex" []
