is_a: GO:0043235 ! receptor complex

[Term]
id: GO:0046697
name: decidualization
namespace: biological_process
def: "The cellular and vascular changes occurring in the endometrium of the pregnant uterus just after the onset of blastocyst implantation. This process involves the proliferation and differentiation of the fibroblast-like endometrial stromal cells into large, polyploid decidual cells that eventually form the maternal component of the placenta." [http://cancerweb.ncl.ac.uk/, ISBN:0721662544, PMID:11133685]
