[Term]
id: GO:0048844
name: artery morphogenesis
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process by which the anatomical structures of arterial blood vessels are generated and organized. Morphogenesis pertains to the creation of form. Arteries are blood vessels that transport blood from the heart to the body and its organs." [GOC:dsf, PMID:16740480]
