namespace: biological_process
def: "The process by which the anatomical structures of neurohypophysis are generated and organized. Morphogenesis pertains to the creation of form. The neurohypophysis is the part of the pituitary gland that secretes hormones involved in blood pressure regulation." [GOC:cls, GOC:dgh, GOC:dph, GOC:jic]
