is_a: GO:0048872 ! homeostasis of number of cells

[Term]
id: GO:0048874
name: homeostasis of number of cells in a free-living population
namespace: biological_process
def: "The biological process involved in maintaining the equilibrium of cell number within a population of free-living cells such as the bacteria in the gut." [GOC:isa_complete]
