namespace: biological_process
def: "The multiplication or reproduction of urothelial cells, resulting in the rapid expansion of a cell population. Urothelial cells make up a layer of transitional epithelium in the wall of the bladder, ureter, and renal pelvis, external to the lamina propria." [ISBN:0721662544]
is_a: GO:0050673 ! epithelial cell proliferation

