namespace: biological_process
def: "The series of events during magnetoception in which a light stimulus is received by a cell and converted into a molecular signal. Downstream processing of the light information in addition to other sensory data allows organisms to perceive the orientation of a magnetic field." [GOC:ai, http://www.wikipedia.org/]
exact_synonym: "magnetoreception, detection of light stimulus" []
