[Term]
id: GO:0051180
name: vitamin transport
namespace: biological_process
def: "The directed movement of vitamins into, out of, within or between cells. A vitamin is one of a number of unrelated organic substances that occur in many foods in small amounts and that are necessary in trace amounts for the normal metabolic functioning of the body." [GOC:ai]
